00:13:21.500 --> 00:13:24.502
next to
Fantasy Island Adult Books,

00:13:24.502 --> 00:13:27.539
across from the Delaware Valley
Cremation Center.

00:13:27.539 --> 00:13:29.241
-That's right --
they held a press conference

00:13:29.241 --> 00:13:30.542
at a landscaping company

00:13:30.542 --> 00:13:33.512
next to an adult bookstore
