00:13:33.512 --> 00:13:34.947
So it was one-stop shopping
for Rudy.

00:13:34.947 --> 00:13:36.215
[ Imitating Rudy Giuliani ]
"This is great.

00:13:36.215 --> 00:13:38.416
I can get my hedges trimmed,
pick up a porno mag,

00:13:38.416 --> 00:13:39.418
