00:13:45.690 --> 00:13:47.626
Such a fitting way
for the Trump presidency to end.

00:13:47.626 --> 00:13:49.461
They tried to stage
a deranged press conference

00:13:49.461 --> 00:13:50.595
to undermine our democracy,

00:13:50.595 --> 00:13:52.531
