their own incompetence.

00:13:53.999 --> 00:13:56.334
Five years ago,
this whole nightmare started

00:13:56.334 --> 00:13:57.870
in a golden tower in Manhattan.

00:13:57.870 --> 00:13:58.871
Now, it's ending

00:13:58.871 --> 00:14:00.940
